ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260822/202608222320134094_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260822/202608222320134094_720.jpg"> </div><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-23/match2075417date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">开门红！皇马2-1西班牙人 埃斯皮替补90分钟绝杀贝林厄姆破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260823/zhanbao_image_2075417_1787433894_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260823/zhanbao_image_2075417_1787433894_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260823/zhanbao_image_2075417_1787433894_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>皇马客场2-1战胜西班牙人取得新赛季开门红！贝林厄姆破门，新援埃斯皮替补绝杀，穆里尼奥回归西甲首战告捷。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-23/match2067651date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">开门黑！热刺0-3惨败布伦特福德 摩尔屡失良机贝里瓦尔失误致丢球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.64" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260823/zhanbao_image_2067651_1787421338_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.64" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.64" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260823/zhanbao_image_2067651_1787421338_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260823/zhanbao_image_2067651_1787421338_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>热刺在联赛首轮0-3惨负于布伦特福德。今夏投入重金引援的热刺，在比赛中全面被动，甚至差点被打出更大的比分。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-23/match2057388date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">开门红！国米4-1蒙扎 恰20世界波皮奥传射迪乌夫2助斯通斯首秀</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.64" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260823/zhanbao_image_2057388_1787421913_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.64" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.64" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260823/zhanbao_image_2057388_1787421913_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260823/zhanbao_image_2057388_1787421913_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>意甲首轮，国米4-1轻取蒙扎，恰尔汗奥卢轰入精彩世界波，泽林斯基、皮奥和比塞克都取得进球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-23/match1989855date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德超杯2连冠！拜仁2-1多特 奥利塞传射布朗破门 拜尔错失绝平单刀</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-23/6a89bda6ae074native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">卫冕德超杯！拜仁击败多特夺得赛季首冠，队史12冠断档领跑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260823/zhanbao_image_1989855_1787430372_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260823/zhanbao_image_1989855_1787430372_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260823/zhanbao_image_1989855_1787430372_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>拜仁2-1击败多特，德超杯两连冠！拜仁方面布朗、奥利塞各入一球。拜仁将德超杯夺冠次数刷新至12次，继续领跑历史榜单。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-22/match2067650date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">遭绝杀！森林0-1利兹联 米伦科维奇中柱 斯塔赫任意球破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260822/202608222353333220.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260822/202608222353333220.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260822/202608222353333220.jpg"> </div><p>森林0-1被利兹联绝杀，遭遇新赛季开门黑。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-22/match2067649date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">伊普斯维奇2-1绝杀桑德兰 克拉克替补建功恩西索一条龙助攻+伤退</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260822/zhanbao_image_2067649_1787414005_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260822/zhanbao_image_2067649_1787414005_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260822/zhanbao_image_2067649_1787414005_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>伊普斯维奇2-1击败桑德兰，绝杀球来自杰克·克拉克。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-22/match2067648date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">开门红！埃弗顿2-0水晶宫 霍尔巴里建功恩凯蒂亚马特塔中柱</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260822/zhanbao_image_2067648_1787413267_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260822/zhanbao_image_2067648_1787413267_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260822/zhanbao_image_2067648_1787413267_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>弗顿在主场以2-0击败水晶宫，迎来新赛季开门红。</p><p>【穆帅赛后】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-23/6a8a1ad4aaebdnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">穆帅：维尼修斯不是圣人，对手做的太过了，轮流去踢他</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-23/6a8a1e087b852native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">穆帅：球队体能没到最佳 对埃斯皮满意 球员要自己应对替补沮丧感</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.64" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260823/202608230632599766.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.64" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.64" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260823/202608230632599766_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260823/202608230632599766_720.jpg"> </div><p>皇马2-1绝杀西班牙人，穆里尼奥赛后出席发布会，谈到了维尼修斯、贝林厄姆、姆巴佩等夺冠话题。吧友们，久违的穆帅赛后回来了！</p><p>【转会新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-22/6a89c1e725a4cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：切尔西后卫巴迪亚西勒租借加盟那不勒斯，买断选项2700万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="ht